#
# Conformance case: quality/ladder-wellformed
# AC: YAMATO quality stratification — the well-formed ladder yields zero violations.
#
# ex:Q instantiates a generic quality AND plays a quality-role (so
# QualityRoleWithoutGeneric does NOT fire); ex:M bears a true quantity and a unit
# AND declares a reference frame (so MeasurementFrameMissing does NOT fire) — a
# fully-formed persistent-quality + generic-role ladder + framed measurement. The
# chase seeds only from input.nq world facts; this program is the mirror axiom.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/quality/ladder-wellformed/> .

ex:Q logic:genericQuality ex:pressure .
ex:Q logic:qualityRole    ex:systolicRole .
ex:M logic:trueQuantity   ex:mag .
ex:M logic:unit           ex:mmHg .
ex:M logic:referenceFrame ex:clinicalFrame .
